OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fbright end to the day with plenty of
OL,7,Fevening sunshine. Cloud increasing
OL,8,Ffrom the west overnight with the
OL,9,Fpotential for the odd spot of rain by
OL,10,Fdawn. Light winds throughout.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FStaying largely cloudy on
OL,13,FSunday with a few spots of rain
OL,14,Fpossible. Turning brighter through the
OL,15,Fafternoon, with light winds throughout.
