OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy on Monday, with rain expected,
OL,7,Flight at first, but turning heavy
OL,8,Flater. This clearing to sunny spells
OL,9,Fand scattered showers for Tuesday and
OL,10,FWednesday. Temperatures near average.
